{"title":"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 40","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_40\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 40</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_40\">Problem 40</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 40\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/4/2a469dc6928d52de594a432d30821d7e5e61325d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left (a+\\frac{1}{a} \\right )^2=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"112\" height=\"46\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/4/69423c9838ab5e6fb25ca771a0cfa77a5acc5a84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3+\\frac{1}{a^3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"59\" height=\"37\" /> equals: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/787b98a9026085b199ba53c5dfafa997f6b6a745.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{10\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 3\\sqrt{3}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 0\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 7\\sqrt{7}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 6\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"459\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/e/10e7533eff12eee4fcc3200fa48eff4253899800.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+\\frac{1}{a}=\\sqrt{3}\\implies (a+\\frac{1}{a})^3=3\\sqrt{3}\\implies a^3+3\\frac{a^2}{a}+\\frac{3a}{a^2}+\\frac{1}{a^3}\\implies a^3+3(a+\\frac{1}{a})+\\frac{1}{a^3}=3\\sqrt{3}\\implies a^3+\\frac{1}{a^3}+3\\sqrt{3}=3\\sqrt{3}\\implies a^3+\\frac{1}{a^3}=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"1101\" height=\"41\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/7/ef7ef72cd47d554d4b473d7e68935e75a19c0e7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"25\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/6/756dc6eab21d77b74315dc64b6a9ce7ae5edba79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left (a+\\frac{1}{a} \\right )^2=3 \\implies a+\\frac{1}{a} =\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"256\" height=\"46\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/1/fe1f2f11807e971c7dcce995bdcb2604de29db1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+\\frac{1}{a} =\\sqrt{3} \\implies (a+\\frac{1}{a})^3=\\sqrt{3^3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"267\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/a/63a5cbe741f935231c826122bf028b4dd1e6037e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+\\frac{1}{a})^3=\\sqrt{3^3}\\implies a^3+3a^2\\frac{1}{a}+3a\\frac{1}{a^2}+\\frac{1}{a^3}=\\sqrt{27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"414\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/f/6cf710f60a41ecc0c7f8e20b670c7374a5bd2d03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3+3a^2\\frac{1}{a}+3a\\frac{1}{a^2}+\\frac{1}{a^3}=\\sqrt{27} \\implies a^3+\\frac{1}{a^3}+3a+\\frac{3}{a}=\\sqrt{27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"486\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/e/50e33b548ac9ac51ff031e8520423de043f67686.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3+\\frac{1}{a^3}+3a+\\frac{3}{a}=\\sqrt{27} \\implies a^3+\\frac{1}{a^3}+3(a+\\frac{1}{a})=\\sqrt{27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"453\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/b/d2bc3b3bbf7fca6a0c31dd9c08d01cff3405044c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3+\\frac{1}{a^3}+3(a+\\frac{1}{a})=\\sqrt{27} \\implies a^3+\\frac{1}{a^3}+3(\\sqrt{3})=\\sqrt{27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"446\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/9/9e990acd31095deb5c1cb7e907255dd6bf1fdb83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3(\\sqrt{3})=\\sqrt{27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/0/eb08876cceebe8ae3e5802193415b796114a2f81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3+\\frac{1}{a^3}=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"93\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/5/8058983ad245aab97730c5808c72d47f423f92f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+\\frac{1}{a})=\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"108\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/3/5931ec06db54093979731c20a19ecd29660b2443.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{2}+2+\\frac{1}{a^{2}}=3 \\Rightarrow a^{2}+\\frac{1}{a^{2}}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"246\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/0/3e05318b83f93582c99540fa0951a832294cdf96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a^{3}+\\frac{1}{a^{3}})=(a+\\frac{1}{a})(a^{2}-1+\\frac{1}{a^{2}}) \\Rightarrow (a^{3}+\\frac{1}{a^{3}})=\\sqrt{3}(1-1) \\Rightarrow \\fbox{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"521\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017161323\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.023 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 85/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3972/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:15020:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017161323 and revision id 121725. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}